inition":"The (male or female) genitals.","example":"... ſhe, with the greateſt effrontery imaginable, unbuttons his breeches, and removing his ſhirt, draws out his affair, ſo ſhrunk and diminiſh’d that I could not but remember the difference, now creſt-fallen, or just faintly lifting its head: but our experinc’d matron very ſoon, by chafing it with her hands, brought it to ſwell to that ſize and erection I had before ſeen it up to.","pos":"noun","synonyms":[],"antonyms":[],"collocations":[],"usage":"archaic, slang","register":"archaic, slang","wordFamily":["affair baby","affairette","affairless","affair of honor","affair of honour","affair partner","cyberaffair","emotional affair","have an affair","love affair","nonaffair","Ugandan affairs"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/affair#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}],"pronunciation":{"ipa":"/əˈfɛə/","us":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ce/En-us-affair.ogg/En-us-affair.ogg.mp3"},"wordFamily":["affair baby","affairette","affairless","affair of honor","affair of honour","affair partner","cyberaffair","emotional affair","have an affair","love affair","nonaffair","Ugandan affairs"]}